{"seq":3,"slug":"pixel-manipulation","title":"像素操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/canvas-2d-graphics/rendering/pixel-manipulation","wordCount":973,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"像素操作\">像素操作</h1><p>到目前为止所有绘制都是「下命令、浏览器替你涂像素」。像素操作把这扇门彻底打开：<code>getImageData</code> 让你拿到画布某块区域每个像素的红绿蓝透明四个字节，<code>putImageData</code> 让你把改过的字节写回去。这是图像滤镜、实时取色、阈值分割、生成艺术等一切「按像素思考」的算法的入口。但它也是 Canvas 里最容易拖垮性能的操作——读回像素可能强迫 GPU 把整块画布同步回 CPU 内存，所以这一篇既讲怎么用，也重点讲怎么用得不慢。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><code>getImageData(x, y, w, h)</code> 返回一个 <code>ImageData</code> 对象，其 <code>data</code> 是一个 <code>Uint8ClampedArray</code>，按行优先、每像素 4 字节（R、G、B、A，各 0–255）紧密排列。像素 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(px, py)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的红色分量下标为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i = (py \\cdot w + px) \\cdot 4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>随后 <code>i+1</code>、<code>i+2</code>、<code>i+3</code> 分别是绿、蓝、透明度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;画布像素 (GPU 可能持有)&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;getImageData(x,y,w,h)&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;ImageData.data&lt;br/&gt;Uint8ClampedArray RGBA&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;按 i=(y*w+x)*4 索引读写&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;逐像素算法&lt;br/&gt;灰度/反色/卷积&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;putImageData(imageData, dx, dy)&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; A&#10;  G[&quot;willReadFrequently 提示&quot;] -.-&gt;|&quot;影响读回开销&quot;| B\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"画布像素 (GPU 可能持有)\"] --&gt; B[\"getImageData(x,y,w,h)\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"ImageData.data&lt;br/&gt;Uint8ClampedArray RGBA\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"按 i=(y*w+x)*4 索引读写\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"逐像素算法&lt;br/&gt;灰度/反色/卷积\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"putImageData(imageData, dx, dy)\"]\n  F --&gt; A\n  G[\"willReadFrequently 提示\"] -.-&gt;|\"影响读回开销\"| B</pre><p>注意 <code>Uint8ClampedArray</code> 会把越界值自动钳制到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>255</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[0,255]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">255</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>：写 300 得 255，写 -10 得 0，这对图像运算很方便，省去手动 clamp。</p>\n<h2 id=\"读写像素-getimagedata-与-putimagedata\">读写像素：getImageData 与 putImageData</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const { width: w, height: h } = canvas;&#10;const img = ctx.getImageData(0, 0, w, h);&#10;const d = img.data;&#10;for (let i = 0; i &lt; d.length; i += 4) {&#10;  const gray = 0.299 * d[i] + 0.587 * d[i + 1] + 0.114 * d[i + 2];&#10;  d[i] = d[i + 1] = d[i + 2] = gray; // 转灰度，A 不动&#10;}&#10;ctx.putImageData(img, 0, 0);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">width</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">w</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">h</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> canvas;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> img</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getImageData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, w, h);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> img.data;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> gray</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.299</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.587</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.114</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  d[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gray; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 转灰度，A 不动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">putImageData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(img, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>灰度系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.299</mn><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0.587</mn><mi>G</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>0.114</mn><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.299R + 0.587G + 0.114B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.299</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.587</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.114</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 来自人眼对绿光最敏感的亮度感知模型（Rec.601）。<code>putImageData</code> 直接覆盖目标区域像素，<strong>不经过当前变换矩阵、也不参与合成</strong>——它是「字节级搬运」，<code>globalAlpha</code>、<code>globalCompositeOperation</code>、CTM 对它统统无效。这点和<a href=\"../foundations/drawing-model\">即时绘制模型</a>里走变换与合成的常规绘制截然不同，是个常见的认知陷阱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"willreadfrequently-读回性能的关键开关\">willReadFrequently：读回性能的关键开关</h2><p>现代浏览器默认把 2D 画布放在 GPU 上以加速绘制。但 <code>getImageData</code> 要把像素读回 CPU，这会触发一次 GPU→CPU 回读，代价高昂；若你每帧都读（如实时取色笔、视频逐帧处理），帧率会断崖式下跌。</p>\n<p>解决办法是在创建上下文时给出提示 <code>willReadFrequently: true</code>（在 <a href=\"../foundations/canvas-api\">Canvas API 篇</a>介绍过这个配置项），浏览器据此倾向用 CPU 后端，避免反复回读：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"const ctx = canvas.getContext(&#39;2d&#39;, { willReadFrequently: true });\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ctx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> canvas.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2d'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, { willReadFrequently: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> });</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>是否设 willReadFrequently</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>纯绘制、偶尔截图</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>保留 GPU 加速绘制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实时取色 / 滤镜每帧读</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>避免每帧 GPU→CPU 回读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大量 putImageData 写回</td>\n<td>视情况</td>\n<td>写回同样可能涉及同步</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>是否真正生效可用 <code>getContextAttributes().willReadFrequently</code> 回读确认。这条「按访问模式选后端」是<a href=\"../advanced/performance-optimization\">性能优化</a>的一个具体落点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ctx-filter-声明式滤镜的替代路径\">ctx.filter：声明式滤镜的替代路径</h2><p>不是所有图像处理都得手写像素循环。<code>ctx.filter</code> 接受与 CSS <code>filter</code> 同语法的字符串（<code>blur()</code>、<code>brightness()</code>、<code>grayscale()</code>、<code>drop-shadow()</code> 等），由浏览器（通常在 GPU 上）对后续绘制施加滤镜，性能远胜逐像素循环：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"ctx.filter = &#39;blur(4px) brightness(1.2)&#39;;&#10;ctx.drawImage(img, 0, 0);&#10;ctx.filter = &#39;none&#39;; // 记得复位，否则污染后续绘制\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.filter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'blur(4px) brightness(1.2)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">drawImage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(img, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ctx.filter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'none'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 记得复位，否则污染后续绘制</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方式</th>\n<th>适合</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>灵活度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>getImageData</code> 逐像素</td>\n<td>自定义算法、卷积、阈值</td>\n<td>慢（CPU + 回读）</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ctx.filter</code></td>\n<td>模糊、亮度、色相等标准效果</td>\n<td>快（GPU）</td>\n<td>受限于内置滤镜</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>经验法则：标准视觉效果优先用 <code>ctx.filter</code>；只有需要自定义逐像素逻辑（取色、生成艺术、机器视觉预处理）时才下沉到 <code>getImageData</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"画布污染与安全边界\">画布污染与安全边界</h2><p><code>getImageData</code>、<code>toDataURL</code>、<code>toBlob</code> 都会读出画布内容，浏览器为防跨站读取隐私图像，规定：一旦画布上画过未正确配置 CORS 的跨域图像或视频，画布即被「污染」（tainted），此后这些读出操作一律抛 <code>SecurityError</code>。绘制本身不受影响，只有读回被禁。要避免污染，跨域图像须在加载时设 <code>img.crossOrigin = &#39;anonymous&#39;</code> 且服务器返回允许的 CORS 头——这与<a href=\"text-images\">文本与图像</a>里提到的图像源处理一脉相承。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>getImageData</code> 返回 <code>ImageData</code>，<code>data</code> 是行优先 RGBA 的 <code>Uint8ClampedArray</code>，像素索引 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i=(y\\cdot w+x)\\cdot4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span>，越界值自动钳制。</li>\n<li><code>putImageData</code> 是字节级搬运，<strong>绕过变换、合成与 globalAlpha</strong>，与常规绘制行为不同。</li>\n<li><code>getImageData</code> 会触发 GPU→CPU 回读，高频读用 <code>willReadFrequently:true</code> 让浏览器切 CPU 后端避免卡顿。</li>\n<li>标准视觉效果优先用 <code>ctx.filter</code>（GPU、快），自定义逐像素算法才用 <code>getImageData</code>（慢但任意）。</li>\n<li>跨域图像未正确配 CORS 会污染画布，导致后续 <code>getImageData</code>/<code>toDataURL</code> 抛 <code>SecurityError</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"像素操作","id":"像素操作"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"读写像素：getImageData 与 putImageData","id":"读写像素-getimagedata-与-putimagedata"},{"level":2,"text":"willReadFrequently：读回性能的关键开关","id":"willreadfrequently-读回性能的关键开关"},{"level":2,"text":"ctx.filter：声明式滤镜的替代路径","id":"ctx-filter-声明式滤镜的替代路径"},{"level":2,"text":"画布污染与安全边界","id":"画布污染与安全边界"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"文本与图像","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/canvas-2d-graphics/rendering/text-images"},"next":{"title":"动画循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/canvas-2d-graphics/interaction/animation-loop"}}